  "sections": [
    {
      "title": "New Ported God",
      "anchor": "New_Ported_God",
      "level": 2,
      "subsections": [
        {
          "title": "Osiris",
          "anchor": "Osiris",
          "level": 3,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "General"
            },
            {
              "type": "list",
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Melee Basic Attacks"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Damage Type: Physical"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Scaling Type: Strength, with Protection Scaling on some abilities"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Passive: Fragmented"
            },
            {
              "type": "list",
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lose a Fragment of your body each time you use an ability, gaining 2% Damage Mitigation for each missing Fragment.",
                  "items": [
                    {
                      "text": "After Losing 8 fragments, become a spirit for 6 successful basic attacks: walk through enemies and enemy blockers, gain Attack Speed, and your basic attacks ignore movement speed penalty."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Ability 1: Sickle Strike"
            },
            {
              "type": "list",
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Throw your Sickle, dealing Physical Damage and slowing the first god hit. It passes through minions."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Ability 2: Spirit Flail"
            },
            {
              "type": "list",
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Strike the target area with your flail, dealing Physical Damage and granting movement speed.",
                  "items": [
                    {
                      "text": "Enemies affected by Sickle Strike have their slow increased in power and duration."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Ability 3: Judgement Tether"
            },
            {
              "type": "list",
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tether yourself to nearby enemy Gods. Tethered enemies have reduced attack speed and reduced damage for 4 seconds.",
                  "items": [
                    {
                      "text": "The tether breaks if targets move far enough away."
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Targets still in range when the duration expires are stunned."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Ultimate Ability: Lord of the Afterlife"
            },
            {
              "type": "list",
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Leap to a target location, dealing physical damage and rooting enemies. Apply a negative cooldown reduction and healing prevention to enemy gods hit.",
                  "items": [
                    {
                      "text": "On Use: Immediately gain maximum Fragment Stacks"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Aspect of of the Fragmented (Releasing October 10th)"
            },
            {
              "type": "list",
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Abilities now scale with intelligence only. Fragments are lost passively on casts and on ability god hits. Osiris games % Damage dealt or Damage Mitigated based on how whole he is."
                },
                {
                  "text": "Sickle Strike has no cooldown and costs 4 Fragments."
                },
                {
                  "text": "Spirit Flail consumes Sickle Strike for bonus damage but no slow."
                },
                {
                  "text": "Lord of the Afterlife summons a slowing, damage-dealing specter. You no longer leap to location"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "New Aspect",
      "anchor": "New_Aspect",
      "level": 2,
      "subsections": [
        {
          "title": "Loki - New Aspect - Aspect of Agony",
          "anchor": "Loki_-_New_Aspect_-_Aspect_of_Agony",
          "level": 3,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "list",
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Loki’s previous Aspect was underperforming and failed to hit the mark of making him a viable Support or Solo. This new, replacement Aspect is intended to fill that niche"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Vanish no longer grants Stealth; its attach now inflicts Blind instead of Bleed."
                },
                {
                  "text": "Agonizing Visions can be cast on allies, providing damage mitigation while slowing enemies."
                },
                {
                  "text": "Behind You now deals bonus damage scaling with your Health and Protections rather than its percentage ioncrease"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
